1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,620
Booking the Iberostar Rose Hall Suites?
Here's what to know before you pay.

2
00:00:04,970 --> 00:00:09,196
A five star, all inclusive resort, in
Montego Bay, Jamaica.

3
00:00:09,746 --> 00:00:11,959
Guests rate it eight point four out of
ten.

4
00:00:13,309 --> 00:00:16,186
It has three hundred fifteen rooms, and
four pools.

5
00:00:17,536 --> 00:00:19,736
It has seven restaurants and six bars.

6
00:00:21,086 --> 00:00:22,702
And it sits right on the beach.

7
00:00:25,367 --> 00:00:29,377
First, what's worth your time. And stay
until the end, for the honest score.

8
00:00:30,783 --> 00:00:35,510
The beach and the pools come first. There
are four pools, a lazy river, and free

9
00:00:35,530 --> 00:00:36,875
access to a water park.

10
00:00:37,295 --> 00:00:42,275
Then the room. Every room is a suite, with
a balcony or a terrace. The junior suite

11
00:00:42,295 --> 00:00:44,383
is about fifty three square meters.

12
00:00:44,803 --> 00:00:49,581
And the food. The buffet is open every
day: breakfast from seven to ten, lunch

13
00:00:49,601 --> 00:00:54,071
from one to three, and dinner from six
thirty to ten. Then the a la carte

14
00:00:54,091 --> 00:00:55,916
restaurants, and a steakhouse.

15
00:00:56,733 --> 00:00:58,400
Now, what does it really cost?

16
00:00:59,783 --> 00:01:04,025
With the all inclusive package, you get
the suite, the buffet, the pools and the

17
00:01:04,045 --> 00:01:04,345
beach.

18
00:01:04,764 --> 00:01:09,121
Not included: the spa, scuba diving, golf,
and some premium drinks.

19
00:01:09,521 --> 00:01:14,919
And hidden fees? Expedia lists no resort
fee, and tips are included. But smoking in

20
00:01:14,939 --> 00:01:17,203
a room costs three hundred dollars.

21
00:01:18,033 --> 00:01:19,719
So, what do guests really say?

22
00:01:21,117 --> 00:01:22,716
Here's what's behind that score.

23
00:01:23,116 --> 00:01:26,760
What guests love: the staff. Reviews name
them again and again.

24
00:01:27,161 --> 00:01:29,659
The evening shows and the entertainment
team.

25
00:01:30,059 --> 00:01:31,667
And the clean beach and pools.

26
00:01:32,067 --> 00:01:35,594
What they complain about: a buffet that is
sometimes lukewarm.

27
00:01:35,994 --> 00:01:37,446
Some rooms feel dated.

28
00:01:37,847 --> 00:01:39,825
And waits at the a la carte restaurants.

29
00:01:41,183 --> 00:01:46,027
Now, the don't list. Don't skip the dinner
booking. Some a la carte restaurants ask

30
00:01:46,047 --> 00:01:47,082
for a reservation.

31
00:01:47,501 --> 00:01:51,378
Don't tip because someone pushes you.
Gratuities are already included.

32
00:01:51,778 --> 00:01:55,424
Don't say yes to the timeshare
presentation. Guests call it high

33
00:01:55,444 --> 00:01:55,940
pressure.

34
00:01:56,360 --> 00:02:00,628
And don't buy from the vendors on the
public beach. The hotel says it doesn't

35
00:02:00,648 --> 00:02:01,631
control that area.

36
00:02:02,467 --> 00:02:04,012
Now, where is it exactly?

37
00:02:05,417 --> 00:02:09,326
The nearest airport is Sangster
International, about twenty minutes by

38
00:02:09,346 --> 00:02:09,607
road.

39
00:02:10,027 --> 00:02:12,681
A taxi costs around thirty five dollars a
car.

40
00:02:13,081 --> 00:02:16,010
The shared shuttle is about thirteen
dollars a person.

41
00:02:16,410 --> 00:02:20,363
Around the hotel, the Star Cafe is about
sixty seconds on foot.

42
00:02:20,763 --> 00:02:23,554
The Rose Hall Great House is fifteen
minutes by car.

43
00:02:23,954 --> 00:02:26,678
And Doctor's Cave Beach is thirty five
minutes out.

44
00:02:28,067 --> 00:02:29,141
When should you go?

45
00:02:30,550 --> 00:02:32,983
The best weather runs from December to
April.

46
00:02:33,383 --> 00:02:35,067
That's also when prices peak.

47
00:02:35,467 --> 00:02:38,937
From June to October, it's the rainy and
hurricane season.

48
00:02:39,337 --> 00:02:43,441
The sweet spot is May and November: good
weather, and lower prices.

49
00:02:44,833 --> 00:02:46,149
And now, the verdict.

50
00:02:47,517 --> 00:02:49,485
It's great for families and couples.

51
00:02:49,886 --> 00:02:54,021
It's not for guests who want premium
drinks included, or brand new rooms.

52
00:02:54,422 --> 00:02:56,428
The honest score: eight out of ten.

53
00:03:00,133 --> 00:03:05,112
That was the Iberostar Rose Hall Suites.
Which hotel should we check out next? Tell

54
00:03:05,132 --> 00:03:06,256
me in the comments.
